<title>FRANCE: PSA's Citroen to cut 800 jobs.</title>
<headline>PSA's Citroen to cut 800 jobs.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Automobiles Citroen, a branch of the car manufacturing group PSA Peugeot Citroen, will propose a plan that includes 800 job cuts between May 1997 and September 1998, a spokesman for Citroen said on Friday.</p>
<p>Citroen employs around 28,000 people.</p>
</text>
